  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Lure?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Green_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225800\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A lure\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Green_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225800\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A lure</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Tackle_Box.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143616\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A Tackle Box\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Tackle_Box.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20191028143616\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A Tackle Box</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Lures</b> are are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27.\n</p><p>They are used to catch&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish</a>, which produce&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/fish-fillet-18999\" title=\"Fish Fillet\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">fish fillets</a>. There are five types of lures: red, green, blue, purple and yellow. Different lures attract different fish.\n</p><p>Like all fishing gear, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tackle box</a> and cannot be bought or sold, but lures can be requested in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"/wiki/neighborhood-10438\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">neighborhood requests</a>.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/truck-2673\" title=\"Truck\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Truck</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> never request lure.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making lures</b></span></h3>\n<p>Lures are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a> using <a href=\"/wiki/voucher-3671\" title=\"Voucher\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">vouchers</a> (except red lures, which require no raw materials).\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>Duration\n</th>\n<th>Experience\n</th>\n<th>Ingredients\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/96/Red_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225706\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red Lure\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/9/96/Red_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225706\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br><b><a href=\"/wiki/red-lure-30467\" title=\"Red Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Red lure</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 h 30 min<br>★★★1 h 16 min\n</td>\n<td>1<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>None\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c4/Green_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225800\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Green Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br><b><a href=\"/wiki/green-lure-30469\" title=\"Green Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Green lure</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 h 15 min<br>★★★1 h 3 min\n</td>\n<td>2<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>1<span>greenv</span><span title=\"Green voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"greenv\"><img alt=\"greenv\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/12/Blue_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225859\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br><b><a href=\"/wiki/blue-lure-30470\" title=\"Blue Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blue lure</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 h<br>★★★51 min\n</td>\n<td>3<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>1<span>bluev</span><span title=\"Blue voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"bluev\"><img alt=\"bluev\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/17/Purple_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330225936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Purple Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br><b><a href=\"/wiki/purple-lure-33409\" title=\"Purple Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Purple lure</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>45 min<br>★★★38 min\n</td>\n<td>4<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>1<span>purplev</span><span title=\"Purple voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"purplev\"><img alt=\"purplev\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a8/Gold_Lure.png/revision/latest?cb=20140330230009\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Gold Lure\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><br><b><a href=\"/wiki/gold-lure-33410\" title=\"Gold Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gold lure</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>30 min<br>★★★25 min\n</td>\n<td>5<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>1<span>goldv</span><span title=\"Golden voucher(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"goldv\"><img alt=\"goldv\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Lure packs</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Lure packs are one-time limited offers for a bundle of lures, <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a> in exchange for real currency. The offer lasts for 24 hours.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<p><b>Trivia</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>The Red Lure resembles a worm, and the Blue Lure resembles a dragonfly.</li>\n<li>The Red Lure is the first item that does not require any materials to make.</li>\n<li>Lures are the only items in the game which require vouchers to be produced.</li>\n<li>The “Blue Lure”, despite its name and the color voucher needed to create one, is actually teal or cyan in color.</li>\n<li>Using a glitch related to having multiple farms, it is actually possible to acquire fishing lures before level 27 using Neighborhood Requests.</li></ul>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831145805\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 172/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3410/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 856013/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   28.641      1 -total\n 81.61%   23.374      9 Template:Infoicon\n  7.05%    2.018      1 Template:Languages\n  4.69%    1.343      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  3.92%    1.122      1 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:5882-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831145805 and revision id 103613. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
